                  "Html": "\u003Cp\u003EAn important goal of the Virtual Photonics Technology Initiative is the development and distribution of appropriate educational materials to the Biomedical Optics community. Currently we have the following content:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli style=\u0022padding-left: 30px\u0022\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022training-programs\u0022 title=\u0022Multiscale Biophotonics Training Program\u0022\u003EMultiscale Biophotonics Training Program\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli style=\u0022padding-left: 30px\u0022\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/shortcourses\u0022 title=\u0022Short Courses\u0022\u003EEducational materials from our Computational Biophotonics Short Courses\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli style=\u0022padding-left: 30px\u0022\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/workshops\u0022 title=\u0022Workshops\u0022\u003EEducational materials from our Virtual Photonics Workshops\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli style=\u0022padding-left: 30px\u0022\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022/mcsc\u0022 title=\u0022Monte Carlo Short Course\u0022\u003ESpanier Lectures on Monte Carlo Methods and Virtual Photonics\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E"
